{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["<b>On that day it shall be eaten.</b> It does not come to warn but rather that the slaughter be on that condition — for if to fix him a time for eating, it is already written: ״וּבְשַׂר זֶבַח תּוֹדַת שְׁלָמָיו וְגוֹ׳״ (Leviticus 7)." "<b>I am YHWH.</b> Know who decreed the matter, and let it not be light in your eyes."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:07:49.755195039Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}